{
  "_comment": [
    "Booster + sustainer, the LOW/MID-POWER gap-staging pattern, flown by both the",
    "engine we ship and pristine upstream core.",
    "",
    "Different code path from staged-flight.json, which is why it is a separate",
    "fixture rather than a tweak of it. Here the booster motor's ejection charge does",
    "two jobs at once: it separates the booster AND lights the sustainer, because the",
    "sustainer's motor keeps its default AUTOMATIC ignition instead of being handed a",
    "timer. There is no 'ignition' block below for exactly that reason - adding one",
    "would test the timed path again. The booster carries no parachute and falls on",
    "its own branch.",
    "",
    "Mirrors ParityMain.runStagingScenario's 'auto' case. Everything else follows the",
    "same rules as staged-flight.json: every aero- and mass-relevant property",
    "explicit, and every component that can be an event source named."
  ],
